/*!
    \qmltype MySingleton2
    \nativetype MySingleton2
    \inqmlmodule Test
    \since QmlSingletonTest 1.0
    \brief A QML singleton type that tests name collision detection.

    This type is linked to the correct C++ class (MySingleton2) via \nativetype,
    ensuring that the singleton flag comes from the correctly associated ClassNode,
    not from name-based heuristics that could match the wrong class.

    The presence of TestNamespace::MySingleton2 (which doesn't have QML_SINGLETON)
    tests that we don't accidentally mark the wrong class as singleton.
*/
